==Trivia==
*Million-Dollar Cat was originally obtainable from the [[Catnip Challenges]] during the [[Anniversary/9th Year|9th Anniversary Event]].
*Million-Dollar Cat's bunny ears, heels and fishnet stockings in the Evolved Form are likely references to [[wikipedia:Playboy Bunny|Playboy Bunny]] waitresses.
*Million-Dollar Cat has the second lowest base DPS in the game, beating out the long-time previous holder [[Balaluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Balalan Pasalan]] and itself only beaten by [[Healer (Special Cat)|Healer]].
**However, its effective DPS caused by its guaranteed Critical Hits is only the third lowest, being higher than Balalan by 1 point.

